  "sourceTitle": "your MLX MTP head may be silently ignored — check for mode=mtp, not just the flag",
  "sourceBodyHash": "78cbd197340e4535c96ade8c5d1addac17f53496b23be91c17af13aaf880d866",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "bigmodel",
  "requestedModel": "glm-4.7-flash",
  "model": "glm-4.7-flash",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-25T20:46:55.956876Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-09-29T21:04:15.669633Z",
  "totalBlocks": 26,
  "translatedBlocks": 26,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "847febce1391b4ba",
      "translationZh": "在 M2 Max 上花了一个晚上将 mlx-serve 与 LM Studio 进行基准测试，发现了一些值得分享的东西，",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f6dc9080740f456d",
      "translationZh": "因为它在无形中消耗掉了你大部分的加速效果。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9ec2e9fbae9d3bf2",
      "translationZh": "需要注意的地方是：mlx-serve 要求 MTP sidecar 的张量必须带有 `mtp.` 前缀 —— 例如 `mtp.fc.weight`，",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "632879d413d1a21b",
      "translationZh": "`mtp.layers.0…`。以 `mlx-community/Qwen3.8-27B-MTP-4bit` (239 MB) 形式发布的权重在发布时并未包含它们",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a636c7acaa66347e",
      "translationZh": "一个前缀：`fc.weight`、`layers.0…`。将其丢进去后，服务器启动时既没有错误，也没有警告，什么都没有",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0691068acc8a81f",
      "translationZh": "在日志中。它只是静默地回退到 Prompt Lookup Decoding。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b7e6713c52fd86c4",
      "translationZh": "如何判断你是否受到影响——请查看规格统计行，而不是启动标志：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de6e05eefeb7e260",
      "translationZh": "[spec-stats] mode=pld ← 推测模式为 PLD，您的 MTP 头部未加载",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bec43e313900f04f",
      "translationZh": "[spec-stats] 模式=mtp 尝试次数=31 接受次数=67 每草稿占比=69.8% 深度=6 ← 这正是你想要的",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0dfb4eba6ef295d7",
      "translationZh": "使用 mx.save_safetensors 将 mx.load(src) 加载的字典项保存到 dst，其中键为 mtp.k，值为 v。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34ae56e0c915c9df",
      "translationZh": "此外：该文件必须位于模型目录下的 mtp/weights.safetensors，而 HF 发布时的路径为",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "31afe9d54bdf81a9",
      "translationZh": "model.safetensors。使用符号链接池（symlink farm）即可正常工作，无需复制权重。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f4988a3ed8bcb717",
      "translationZh": "其价值如何（Qwen3.8-27B 4-bit，相同权重，5 次运行的中位数，每个提示词使用唯一前缀，因此没有任何内容）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9c2ea6b249fef332",
      "translationZh": "是从前缀缓存中提供的):",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "83f89e6d78bd54fc",
      "translationZh": "预填充短/长 解码短 解码长",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "999da484d3d6800c",
      "translationZh": "mlx-serve, MTP 实际上已加载",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9fda4589156d00d2",
      "translationZh": "mlx-serve, 不猜测",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ab5922e58ea6d53e",
      "translationZh": "因此，仅从前缀即可解码出 +63% / +79%。请注意第二行：在没有推测的情况下，LM Studio 的引擎",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ed4f26b838180ec4",
      "translationZh": "实际上在这里速度更快。MTP 是扭转局面的关键，这使得无声地失去它代价高昂。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e704f7cb0b26010",
      "translationZh": "我始终无法克服的一个局限：MoE MTP 头完全无法加载——",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db5d58537ec5f1b8",
      "translationZh": "“MTP 边车加载失败：MlxError”，前缀已经正确。两个成功加载的头部均为",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7bc2b1ead15fd550",
      "translationZh": "dense 和 logged dense-mlp。因此，对于 Qwen3.6-35B-A3B，我什么也没得到，而 dense 27B 可以正常工作。已提交",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d0baca14b25673d",
      "translationZh": "环境：mlx-serve 26.9.5，MLX 0.32.2，macOS 26.6.2，M2 Max 96 GB。数值为解码/预填充的实测结果",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a3fc4908dd8d56f",
      "translationZh": "来自客户端的流，而非服务器自身的计数器。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c6c83975b7a6d929",
      "translationZh": "有人在 Apple Silicon 上通过任何运行时成功运行过 MoE MTP head 吗？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe5238966f3c8988",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Micha0827 提交",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    }
  ],
